wifi/kvm_open.py             An open wifi between virtual machines. Every frame can be read on the air.
wifi/kvm_wpa3.py             W P A 3 between virtual machines. The S A E exchange, then only encrypted frames on the air.
wifi/kvm_bridge.py           A virtual machine access point bridging the air to a cable, one subnet for both.
wifi/kvm_roaming.py          One network, two cells, virtual machines. A station moves, and keeps its address.
wifi/kvm_mesh.py             A wifi mesh of virtual machines. Three radios relaying for each other, no access point.
wifi/cntkvm_home.py          A home box. A virtual machine access point gives a container and a virtual machine their address over the air.
wifi/cntkvm_enterprise.py    W P A 2 Enterprise. A login per user, checked by a radius server, for a container and a virtual machine.
wifi/cntkvm_roaming.py       One network, two cells, a container access point and a virtual machine access point. The station keeps its address.
wifi/cntkvm_monitor.py       Listening to the air. A virtual machine in monitor mode reads an open network, and not a W P A 2 one.

freebsd.py                   FreeBSD. A BSD guest running the cloonix agent.
